  "content": "\n\n<p>如需此模組的資料包版本，請點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<p>為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a> 新增更多 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 切菜板食譜</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支援所有木材類型的樹皮剝除與回收</li>\n<li>從以下來源獲得更多染料：\n<ul>\n<li>可合成 1 份染料的鮮花</li>\n<li>藍莓</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花朵切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/blueberrycutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"藍莓切割\"></p>\n<p>想將所有 Farmer's Cutting 內容整合為單一模組嗎？歡迎查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Cutting Collection</a>！</p>",
